@startuml Export CSV - Interaction Diagram

title Export Search Results to CSV

actor User
participant ":System" as System
participant ":Project" as Project

User -> System : export search results
System --> User : request file path
User -> System : provide file path

System -> Project : get tasks
Project --> System : tasks

System -> System : write(tasks, filePath)

System --> User : confirm export

@enduml
